      "help_en": "The session ID, which identifies a visitor's session and maintains context information. For a new visitor, you do not need to pass this field when calling the Chat operation for the first time. The chatbot starts a session and returns the SessionId in the response. For subsequent conversation turns of the same visitor, pass the current SessionId when calling the Chat operation so that the chatbot can continue the conversation based on the SessionId",
      "help_zh": "会话ID，⽤于标识⼀个访问者的会话和保持上下⽂信息。对于⼀个新的访问者，⾸次调⽤ Chat接⼝时⽆需传递此字段，机器⼈会开启⼀个会话，并在Chat接⼝的响应中返回该会话的 SessionId。对于该访问者的后续轮次的会 话，调⽤Chat接⼝时传递当前会话的 SessionId，机器⼈即可基于SessionId继续该轮次会话",
